        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Epoxy resin, liquid, disaggregated data, at plant
All data are based on Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry. This dataset is used for methodological comparision in the data base. It shall not be used as background data in LCI.;
CAS number: 025928-94-3; 
UUID: 6ac7f2be-a7fc-3bc4-b1ed-3f25e296b817
Disaggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: Data for 4 plants in DE, IT, NL, CH
Technology: Production from epichlorohydrin and bisphenol-A
Time period: Time to which data refer
Production volume: 190000 Tonnes
Sampling: Company data 
Extrapolations: No extrapoloation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6ac7f2be-a7fc-3bc4-b1ed-3f25e296b817.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
